## Slice 1: Project Skeleton and Contracts

- Date: 2026-05-31
- Plan reference: docs/plan.md §2.1
- Status: PASSED (all tests green on first run)

### Objective
Stand up the repository structure for `runtime/`, `extension/`, and `tests/`,
and implement the shared contracts, schemas, and constants that every later
slice depends on.

### Files created
Runtime (Python):
